Third-party dependencies (Cargo crates, Python packages and npm packages) are
not included in this repository. Their exact versions are pinned in Cargo.lock,
uv.lock and webui/package-lock.json, and their licenses are checked in CI.

This repository does not include third-party source files or assets. If third-party
material is added, record its copyright notice and license here and in REUSE.toml.

The following third-party dependencies are not included in this repository, but
they are licensed under weak copyleft licenses instead of a permissive one. They
are installed unmodified from their package registries and remain under their
original licenses.

1. option-ext (Mozilla Public License 2.0)

   Rust crate, pulled in transitively through zenoh-util, shellexpand, dirs and
   dirs-sys.
   Source: https://github.com/soc/option-ext


2. certifi (Mozilla Public License 2.0)

   Python package, pulled in transitively through requests (ray) and pyproj.
   Source: https://github.com/certifi/python-certifi


